If you really want to be spoiled combine these things:

* Dylan's Gazetteer, quest section:
http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/gazetteer/quest/

* The general monster spoiler, for nemesis info:
http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/mon1-343.txt

* Google Groups search for r.g.r.n.:
http://groups.google.com/groups?&group=rec.games.roguelike.nethack

And you will have both the actual facts and lots of semi-trustworthy 
tactics/walkthrough stuff. (You know you can filter out old posts in the 
Google search, or just sort them by date?)

Or do it the Nethack Way and learn from your mistakes... ;)

Pick a random class that you find interesting, and if you're still too 
afraid when quest time comes, post here and ask for advice, and I'm 
certain you will get some useful tips.

Myself I've usually been overly afraid of the nemesises, and killed them 
before I have used even a fraction of my prepared tricks.

